WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.161
One line of latitude runs

2
00:00:02.161 --> 00:00:03.876
right across India.

3
00:00:03.876 --> 00:00:05.233
The Tropic of Cancer,

4
00:00:05.233 --> 00:00:06.804
at about twenty-three and a

5
00:00:06.804 --> 00:00:08.467
half degrees north.

6
00:00:08.795 --> 00:00:11.294
It enters India in Gujarat.

7
00:00:11.294 --> 00:00:12.942
And leaves through Mizoram,

8
00:00:12.942 --> 00:00:14.226
in the east.

9
00:00:14.549 --> 00:00:16.094
Gujarat, Rajasthan,

10
00:00:16.094 --> 00:00:17.285
Madhya Pradesh,

11
00:00:17.285 --> 00:00:19.650
Chhattisgarh. Then Jharkhand,

12
00:00:19.650 --> 00:00:20.618
West Bengal,

13
00:00:20.618 --> 00:00:22.519
Tripura and Mizoram.

14
00:00:22.862 --> 00:00:24.799
It roughly divides the country

15
00:00:24.799 --> 00:00:25.659
in half.

16
00:00:25.659 --> 00:00:27.090
Which is why it shows

17
00:00:27.090 --> 00:00:28.288
up in so many map

18
00:00:28.288 --> 00:00:29.452
questions.

19
00:00:30.152 --> 00:00:31.378
Your turn.

20
00:00:31.378 --> 00:00:32.693
Which state does it not

21
00:00:32.693 --> 00:00:33.953
pass through?
